# Originally generated by the MediaWiki 1.22.2 installer; carried forward to 1.35, then 1.43.
#
# 2026-08-04 — adapted for the Hetzner/Coolify deployment. Changes from the legacy file:
#   * database host/name/user/password, $wgSecretKey and $wgUpgradeKey now come from the
#     environment. The legacy file had all of them hardcoded, including the shared `gahk_dk`
#     password that App A, App B and MediaWiki all used.
#   * $wgDBTableOptions switched MyISAM -> InnoDB: the database was converted before the Aug 4 dump,
#     so the imported tables are InnoDB and update.php must not create new ones as MyISAM.
